Read the repository root `AGENTS.md` for the current workflow and scope.
When the user shares the repository to get started, follow
`docs/CODEX_QUICKSTART.md` and perform authorized setup yourself. Ask the user
for the photograph and ambiguous scene choices, rather than
requiring them to write plans, scripts, or installation commands.
An explicit development, review, or explanation request takes priority.
Generate a saved Blender intermediate in the background and continue to MuJoCo.
Open the local Blender UI only on an explicit user request.
